/runtime/monitor.cc#L458-L636) 按 `wait_ms / lock_profiling_threshold_`（`dalvik.vm.lockprof.threshold`）比例抽样：\n  * **Logcat 告警**：阻塞超 `kLongWaitMs`（Release **100ms**）输出持锁/等锁方法与行号；超 `-Xstackdumplockprofthreshold` 则通过同步 Checkpoint 抓取双方完整 Java 栈。\n  * **EventLog 与 Palette**：[`Monitor::LogContentionEvent`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/monitor_android.cc#L50-L119) 写入二进制 EventLog `dvm_lock_sample`（Tag `20003`，含是否 UI 敏感线程标识）并回调 [`PaletteReportLockContention`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartpalette/include/palette/palette_method_list.h#L53-L63)。\n  * **ATrace 锁切片**：Java `Monitor` 与 ART 内部 [`BaseMutex`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/base/mutex.cc#L170-L190) 竞争时自动生成包含持锁 TID 及代码位置的 Systrace 切片。\n* **阻塞中实时超时抓栈（`PerfMonitor`）**：启用 `-XX:MonitorTimeoutEnable=true`（对 `system_server` 或 `debug.art.monitor.app=true` 生效，[`Monitor::MaybeEnableTimeout`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/monitor.cc#L1774-L1781)）时，[`Mutex::ExclusiveLock`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/base/mutex.cc#L481-L575) 使用带超时的 `futex`（默认 **500ms**），**无需等待锁释放**即可在阻塞期间最多 5 次抓取持锁线程栈，弥补常规锁采样无法观测死锁/长挂起的盲区。\n* **优先级反转缓解**：[`ScopedPriorityChange`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/scoped_thread_priority_change.cc#L27-L79) 在低优线程执行阻塞分配 GC 或 GC 关键阶段临时抬升线程 `nice` 至 `0`。\n\n### 6. 启动、校验耗时与编译服务（ART Service / Dexopt / JVMTI）监测\n* **启动与热点画像**：[`StartupCompletedTask`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/startup_completed_task.cc#L47-L76) 在启动完成时生成临时 [`RuntimeImage`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/runtime_image.h) 并回收启动缓存；[`ProfileSaver`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jit/profile_saver.cc) 异步采集热点方法画像。\n* **慢字节码校验告警**：[`MethodVerifier`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/verifier/method_verifier.cc#L5723-L5734) 对单方法校验耗时超 `VerifierLoggingThreshold`（默认 **100ms**）输出方法名、字节码速率与 Arena 内存开销。\n* **编译遥测与插件 Dex 追踪**：[`Dex2OatStatsReporter`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/Dex2OatStatsReporter.java#L211-L227)、[`BackgroundDexoptJobStatsReporter`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/BackgroundDexoptJobStatsReporter.java#L41-L79)、[`PreRebootStatsReporter`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/prereboot/PreRebootStatsReporter.java#L71-L160) 与 [`OdrMetrics`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/odrefresh/odr_metrics.h#L33-L90) 向 Statsd 上报全场景编译耗时、体积与失败原因；[`DexUseManagerLocal`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/DexUseManagerLocal.java#L104-L126) 持续监测动态 Secondary Dex 加载与跨包复用状态（由 [`DumpHelper`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartservice/service/java/com/android/server/art/DumpHelper.java#L55-L140) 在 `dumpsys` 中输出）。\n* **JVMTI / DDMS 接口**：[`openjdkjvmti`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/openjdkjvmti/events.h#L44-L94)（及扩展 [`ti_extension.cc`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/openjdkjvmti/ti_extension.cc#L153-L420)）与 [`DdmVmInternal`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/native/org_apache_harmony_dalvik_ddmc_DdmVmInternal.cc#L147-L214) 向 Android Studio Profiler 等工具暴露对象分配、GC 停顿、锁竞争事件及每线程 `utime`/`stime`。\n\n---\n\n## 二、 App 稳定性监测与故障诊断机制（Stability & Diagnostics）\n\n### 1. ANR 现场转储与 Pre-ANR 长方法录制（`SignalCatcher`）\n* **Pre-ANR 信号触发录制**：[`SignalCatcher::HandleMultiplexedSigUsr1`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/signal_catcher.cc#L167-L207) 支持通过 `sigqueue(SIGUSR1)` 提前开启指定时长的 `TraceProfiler` 长耗时方法追踪，并在随后收到 `SIGQUIT` 时将 `LongRunningMethods` 输出至 ANR 头部（[`HandleSigQuit`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/signal_catcher.cc#L147-L152)）。\n* **关键线程优先防截断与全量诊断**：[`Runtime::DumpForSigQuit`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/runtime.cc#L2514-L2540) 采集平台 [`DebugStoreGetString`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartbase/base/debugstore.h#L28-L35)、全部线程的 Java+Native 调用栈及持锁/等锁依赖（[`DumpCheckpoint`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/thread_list.cc#L190-L250) 按 [`Thread::DumpOrder`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/thread.h#L390-L395) `kMain` → `kBlocked` → `kLocked` → `kDefault` 排序，防止关键死锁信息因 ANR 文件截断而丢失）、GC/Heap 统计、JNI 引用表、JIT 状态、反优化计数、ART Metrics 与全量 [`BaseMutex`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/runtime.cc#L2533) 锁持有者，经 `PaletteWriteCrashThreadStacks` 写入 `tombstoned`。\n\n### 2. 线程挂起超时看门狗与肇事线程定向 Abort\n* **挂起屏障超时诊断**：[`ThreadList::SuspendAllInternal`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/thread_list.cc#L954-L1076) 与 [`WaitForSuspendBarrier`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/thread_list.cc#L768-L865) 监测线程挂起超时（`-XX:ThreadSuspendTimeout`），期间采集卡死线程 `/proc/<tid>/stat` 内核状态与磁盘统计 `ConciseDiskStats`，并针对调试器挂起态（`t`）或并发 ANR 转储动态豁免超时。\n* **肇事线程精准抓栈（`AbortInThis`）**：最终超时后，调用 [`Thread::AbortInThis`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/thread.cc#L5198-L5206) 向**拒不挂起的肇事线程（culprit）**定向发送 `SIGABRT` 并设置 Abort Message，使 Tombstone 崩溃主线程直接落在该卡死线程上。\n\n### 3. 硬件异常拦截与 Native Crash 信号链（`libsigchain` & `FaultManager`）\n* **信号劫持保护**：[`sigchain.cc`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/sigchainlib/sigchain.cc#L54-L160) 代理 `sigaction` / `sigprocmask`，防止 App 三方 Crash SDK 覆盖 ART 信号处理器。\n* **受管异常转换与崩溃透传**：[`FaultManager`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/fault_handler.cc#L134-L391)（[fault_handler.h](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/fault_handler.h#L153-L224)）拦截 `SIGSEGV` / `SIGBUS` / `SIGSYS`：若故障位于受管编译代码区，交由 [`NullPointerHandler`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/fault_handler.h#L153)（隐式空指针转 `NullPointerException`）、[`StackOverflowHandler`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/fault_handler.h#L200)（栈保护页转 `StackOverflowError`）、[`SuspensionHandler`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/fault_handler.h#L187) 或 `MarkCompact` 的 `userfaultfd` 处理；否则判定为真实 Native 崩溃（含 ARM64 MTE 标签错误 `SEGV_MTEAERR`/`SEGV_MTESERR` 识别），按信号链转发给业务 Crash Handler 及 `debuggerd`。\n\n### 4. OOM 现场自动抓堆与内存耗尽诊断\n* **OOM 自动导出 Perfetto 堆图**：[`Heap::ThrowOutOfMemoryError`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/gc/heap.cc#L1522-L1576) 在抛出异常前回调 [`DumpPerfettoOutOfMemory`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/perfetto_hprof/perfetto_hprof.cc#L1202-L1268)（当 `traced.oome_heap_session.count > 0` 时，挂起父进程并由子进程通过 `\"android.java_hprof.oom\"` 导出崩溃瞬间堆快照）。\n* **空间耗尽与 GC 颠簸诊断**：异常信息区分“容量触顶”、“空间内存碎片”（`LogFragmentationAllocFailure`）以及“连续 Full GC 后剩余空间 `<1%` 且新回收 `<5%` 主动放弃以防假死”；同时通过 [`FinalizerTimeoutMs`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/runtime_options.def#L68)（默认 **10s**）配合 `FinalizerWatchdogDaemon` 监测析构死锁。\n\n### 5. CheckJNI 契约检查与 JNI 引用泄漏监测\n* **CheckJNI 实时拦截**：[`check_jni.cc`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jni/check_jni.cc#L85-L120) 检测未挂载线程访问、带未决异常（Pending Exception）违规调用 JNI、悬垂/错误类型 JNI 引用、非法 Modified UTF-8、Critical 区违规调用 JNI，并对持有 `GetPrimitiveArrayCritical` / `GetStringCritical` 超过 **16ms**（[`kCriticalWarnTimeUs`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jni/check_jni.cc#L86)）输出慢锁警告；违规时通过 [`JavaVMExt::JniAbort`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jni/java_vm_ext.cc#L599-L623) 终止并输出违规方法栈。\n* **JNI 引用表溢出与泄漏追踪**：[`IndirectReferenceTable`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jni/indirect_reference_table.cc) 在 Local/Global/WeakGlobal 引用超限时打印按类聚合的实例数直方图；配置 `-XX:GlobalRefAllocStackTraceLimit`（[`JavaVMExt`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/jni/java_vm_ext.cc#L543-L545)）可在 GlobalRef 余量不足时自动记录分配调用栈。\n\n### 6. 堆内存踩踏取证、编译看门狗与 API 兼容性防护\n* **堆损坏（Heap Corruption）取证**：[`Verification::LogHeapCorruption`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/gc/verification.cc#L95-L128) 在发现非法对象引用时，自动输出损坏对象与持有者的类信息、字段偏移与名称、所属 Space、CardTable 值、邻近内存 Hex Dump（[`DumpRAMAroundAddress`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/gc/verification.cc#L33-L61)）及进程 `maps` 后触发 Abort。\n* **编译超时看门狗与防 Bootloop 退避**：[`dex2oat.cc` 中的 `WatchDog`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/dex2oat/dex2oat.cc#L344-L403) 设置 **9.5 分钟**超时自杀（早于 `PackageManagerService` 10 分钟看门狗，避免拖垮 `system_server`）；[`OdrCompilationLog::ShouldAttemptCompile`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/odrefresh/odr_compilation_log.cc#L182-L218) 对开机编译连续失败执行 `12h * 2^N` 指数退避，防止异常引发无限重启。\n* **非 SDK 接口（Hidden API）与动态加载防护**：[`hidden_api.cc`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/hidden_api.cc#L627-L753) 监测反射/JNI/链接期对灰黑名单 API 的调用，输出 Logcat 告警、按采样率写入 EventLog（`VMRuntime.hiddenApiUsed`）并回调 `nonSdkApiUsageConsumer`，结合 [`CompatFramework`](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/runtime/compat_framework.h) 阻断越权调用；[art-rw-flags.aconfig](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/build/flags/art-rw-flags.aconfig#L106-L122) 同时提供非只读动态代码加载（DCL）的日志上报与异常拦截开关。\n\n---\n\n## 三、 常用调试属性与开启方式速查\n\n| 监测维度 | 关键属性 / 启动参数 | 默认阈值 / 行为 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **慢 GC / 停顿日志** | `-XX:LongPauseLogThreshold=<ms>` / `-XX:LongGCLogThreshold=<ms>` | 前台 STW `>= 5ms` 或总耗时 `> 100ms` 打 Logcat |\n| **锁竞争释放后采样** | `dalvik.vm.lockprof.threshold` / `-Xstackdumplockprofthreshold:<ms>` | 按耗时比例写 `dvm_lock_sample`；`> 100ms` 打警告 |\n| **锁阻塞实时抓栈** | `-XX:MonitorTimeoutEnable=true` + `debug.art.monitor.app=true` | 阻塞每满 `500ms`（200~999ms）抓持锁线程栈（最多 5 次） |\n| **低开销长方法追踪** | `dalvik.vm.allow_profile_code=true` + `sigqueue(SIGUSR1)` | 捕获 `> ~341ms` 方法并在 `SIGQUIT` 输出 `LongRunningMethods` |\n| **OOM 自动堆转储** | `-XX:PerfettoHprof=true` + `traced.oome_heap_session.count` | OOM 抛出前触发 `\"android.java_hprof.oom\"` 抓堆 |\n| **Java 堆分配采样** | `-XX:PerfettoJavaHeapStackProf=true`（`heapprofd` `\"com.android.art\"`） | 默认 `4KB` 采样间隔动态收缩 TLAB 上报分配栈 |\n| **JNI 检查与泄漏追踪** | `debug.checkjni=1` / `-XX:GlobalRefAllocStackTraceLimit=<N>` | Critical 锁 `> 16ms` 告警；GlobalRef 余量 `< N` 记录分配栈 |\n| **ART 遥测指标导出** | `-Xmetrics-write-to-logcat:true` / `dalvik.vm.metrics.*` | 默认 `2%` 会话上报 Statsd，可强制开启输出至 Logcat/文件 |","thinking":"Complete mapping of all application performance and stability monitoring mechanisms within the specified code directory is now available. This involved a source-verified assessment of all elements. Carefully reviewing guidelines related to specific outputs and communication style will be undertaken.\n\n\nThe question calls for a direct, readable response, suggesting a direct answer is appropriate instead of creating an artifact. However, the guidelines also emphasize avoiding summarization of artifact contents, leading to a need to assess whether an artifact would improve readability. Considering the nature of the technical question, a direct response in chat appears to be the most suitable approach.\n\n\nDirect chat response will be structured using markdown for readability, including code-style formatting and clickable links where appropriate to enhance user experience. The format aims for conciseness and clarity, as per guidelines. Mechanisms, thresholds, triggers, and output channels will be clearly categorized.\n\n\nThe initial assessment reveals the codebase resides within the [art](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art) directory, with a specific commit (`9a380e42`) representing the Android 15/16 Mainline ART module architecture. A key file, [palette_method_list.h](file:///home/ethen/workspace/voyah/projects/8397/code/qssi/art/libartpalette/include/palette/palette_method_list.h#L80-L104), signifies an evolution to SDK 36/36.1 interfaces. The structure of this response will include an overview and then a direct response.\n\n\nThe core runtime and compiler are based on a clean AOSP implementation, without vendor-specific instrumentation.  Platform extensions utilize a bridging mechanism.  App performance monitoring encompasses runtime telemetry via metrics that output to statsd, logcat, and files. The metrics are defined within `ArtMetrics`.\n\n\nMetrics collection focuses on runtime performance data. There are event metrics and value metrics. These encompass aspects like class loading, JIT compilation, garbage collection behavior (including stop-the-world times, GC counts, and throughput), as well as app slow-path duration during GC events.\n\nMetrics reporting, performed by a background thread, uses configurable flags to determine output and destination.\n\n\nMetrics sampling occurs at a default rate with configurable periods, and triggered by app lifecycle events (startup completion and exit).  Reported data, including compilation reason and metadata, is written atomically to specific data structures via a reporting mechanism.\n\nGC pause and jank monitoring are also active. Slow GC and long pauses are detected based on a configurable threshold, logged when the app is in a foreground-perceptible state.\n\n\nLong pause logging is enabled when pauses exceed 5ms or total GC time surpasses 100ms. Blocking waits, monitored via `Heap::WaitForGcToCompleteLocked` and JNI critical section thread flip operations (`Heap::IncrementDisableThreadFlip`, `Heap::ThreadFlipBegin`) exceeding 5ms are also logged.\n\nWeak reference processing is monitored for potential stalls, specifically at `ReferenceProcessor::GetReferent`.\n\n\nA trace point is added for `Reference.get()` blocking due to concurrent garbage collection, with a warning log if the block exceeds 10ms. Garbage collection rate histograms are collected within the `Heap` module, offering insights into normal/blocking GC rates. Runtime statistics, including GC counts, wait times, and a pre-OOM rescue counter, are exposed via the `VMDebug` interface.\n\n\nGC sub-stages are automatically mapped to Systrace slices for performance profiling. GC-related page fault counts, reflecting ZRAM/disk paging overhead, are reported using `getrusage`. The current heap size is reported in KB.\n\nNative memory pressure is monitored, and based on `mallinfo()` and registered allocation size, a `gc_urgency` value triggers concurrent Full GC when exceeding thresholds; severe over-limits lead to allocation thread blocking and warnings.\n\nContinuous heap allocation sampling is performed using Perfetto.\n\n\nA `HeapSampler` data source, registered as `\"com.android.art\"`, dynamically adjusts TLAB size using a Poisson exponential distribution with a 4KB default sampling interval; call stacks and byte counts are reported to `heapprofd` during TLAB refills, large object allocations, non-moving object allocations, and native registration allocations, without disrupting fast compilation paths. A Perfetto double-fork heap snapshot (`android.java_hprof`) mechanism uses `perfetto_hprof.cc` to listen for a real-time signal, pauses threads, forks a child process and immediately resumes the parent (minimizing app stutter to milliseconds); the grandchild process, with a 120s `SIGKILL` watchdog, traverses the heap reference graph and correlates with `NativeAllocationRegistry` sizes and `/proc/self/smaps` data, streaming the results into Perfetto in fragments. Traditional allocation tracing also occurs.\n\n\nAllocation tracing utilizes a circular buffer (`AllocRecordObjectMap`) to capture recent allocations, including call stack information.  Synchronous heap dumps are available via `hprof::DumpHeap`.\n\nMethod tracing is implemented using `Trace`, supporting instrumented method tracing (entry/exit/exception recording with Wall/Thread CPU/Dual clocks and streaming) and periodic stack sampling.  `TraceProfiler` enables low-overhead, always-on or on-demand method tracing.\n\n\nHardware counter timestamps are written to a per-thread ring buffer by AOT/JIT code, controlled by flags for all and long-running method tracing (341ms threshold). JIT/DEX method symbols are exposed to `simpleperf`, `perfetto`, and `debuggerd` via `__jit_debug_register_code` and `__dex_debug_register_code`. ELF file offsets for compiled Java methods are available via `VMDebug_getExecutableMethodFileOffsets` for eBPF uprobe monitoring.\n\n\nLock contention monitoring includes proportional sampling of blocked fat locks, enabling configurable threshold-based stack dumps for detailed analysis when waits exceed predefined durations. Logcat warnings and EventLog entries (`dvm_lock_sample`) are generated, capturing thread sensitivity, wait times, and lock locations; these also trigger a callback mechanism. ATrace slices are enabled for Java `Monitor` and internal ART `BaseMutex` for competition visualization.\n\n\nWhen a mutex is blocked, the system now automatically outputs the holding thread ID (TID) and method slices. Real-time stack traces are captured during blocking periods using `PerfMonitor` when `-XX:MonitorTimeoutEnable=true` is enabled; `Mutex::ExclusiveLock` utilizes a timed `futex`. A maximum of 5 stack traces can be captured during the blocking period (default 500ms).\n\nGC and allocation priorities are enhanced using `ScopedPriorityChange`, temporarily raising the Linux `nice` value to `0` for background threads blocking on GC.\n\n\nStartup performance monitoring uses `StartupCompletedTask` to track completion, create a runtime image, and trigger metrics reporting; `ProfileSaver` samples hot methods.  Slow bytecode verification is detected by `MethodVerifier`, with warnings for methods exceeding the `VerifierLoggingThreshold`. Dexopt and OTA compilation are also monitored.\n\n\nART-specific performance and stability monitoring also includes `Dex2OatStatsReporter` which tracks Dex2Oat compilation, and `BackgroundDexoptJobStatsReporter`, `PreRebootStatsReporter`, and `OdrMetrics` for background and pre-reboot operations.  These components report duration, size, exit codes, and signals.  `DexUseManagerLocal` and `DumpHelper` are also used to track dynamic Dex loading and ClassLoader context compliance.\n\n\nJVM Tool Interface and Debugging/Debugging Monitor System (DDMS) interfaces expose events. This enables monitoring object allocation/deallocation, garbage collection control, monitor wait/contention events, and thread CPU time statistics. Pre-ANR long-running method capture is achieved via signal handling.\n\n\nDynamic tracing of long-running methods is initiated via `SIGUSR1`, controlled by `TraceProfiler`, for a specified duration. Upon receiving `SIGQUIT`, long-running methods are directly included in the ANR trace, handled by `HandleSigQuit`.\n\nA prioritized full state dump, including debug store content and thread information, is generated upon `SIGQUIT`. The dump prioritizes thread output based on `Thread::DumpOrder` to prevent crucial deadlock information from being truncated. Heap information is also included in the dump.\n\n\nSystem state, including GC statistics, JNI references, JIT code cache, and ART metrics are periodically written to a crash dump alongside complete `BaseMutex` states.  A thread suspension watchdog monitors for deadlocks using timeouts during suspend operations and gathers `/proc/<tid>/stat` and disk I/O data.  Threads unresponsive to suspend requests (e.g., in a loop or problematic JNI code) are targeted for termination via `Thread::AbortInThis`.\n\n\nThe system targets the non-suspended culprit thread with `SIGABRT` and writes an abort message to prioritize the deadlock thread in `debuggerd` crash dumps, rather than an innocent GC thread.\n\nThe system uses `libsigchain` to intercept `sigaction` and `sigprocmask` calls, preventing application-level crash handlers from overriding ART's signal handling priority.\n\n`FaultManager` intercepts `SIGSEGV`, `SIGBUS`, and `SIGSYS`. Managed exceptions within compiled code are handled by `NullPointerHandler`.\n\n\nSignal handlers are prioritized, with specific handlers for null pointers, stack overflows, suspensions, and `userfaultfd` events.  Non-matching signals, including native memory errors (like MTE `SEGV_MTEAERR` and `SEGV_MTESERR`), are passed to the next signal handler in the chain.\n\nOOM diagnosis triggers an automatic Perfetto heap dump before the `OutOfMemoryError` is thrown, by invoking `OutOfMemoryErrorHook()` to call `DumpPerfettoOutOfMemory()`.\n\n\nOOM scenarios trigger Perfetto heap dumps before exception throwing. Diagnostics pinpoint heap exhaustion, large object fragmentation, or insufficient free space after Full GC to prevent thrashing.\n\nFinalizer timeouts (default 10s) are exposed for `FinalizerWatchdogDaemon` to detect and terminate processes in `finalize()` deadlocks. CheckJNI validates JNI calls in real-time for thread state, pending exceptions, reference issues, and string encoding violations.\n\n\nJNI critical section violations are detected during array/string access, issuing a warning if the lock exceeds a threshold. Fatal violations trigger an abort with stack trace information.\n\nJNI calls can be traced by specified class or third-party libraries using a command line flag. Indirect and local reference tables are limited to prevent overflows.\n\nReference table overflows trigger aggregated statistics and allocation stack traces for leaks.\n\n\nHeap corruption detection dumps detailed information, including object metadata and memory contents, upon finding invalid references, followed by program termination. Compilation watchdogs prevent indefinite restarts by monitoring compilation progress and implementing timeouts. Global reference allocation stack tracing activates when the number of available slots falls below a defined threshold.\n\n\nSystem-server watchdog now kills itself 10 minutes before PackageManagerService to prevent cascading failures.  Failed `odrefresh` attempts employ exponential backoff with a maximum delay of 12h * 2^N to avoid bootloops.\n\nRestricted API access via reflection, JNI, and linking is intercepted; violations generate logcat warnings, sampled EventLog reports (`VMRuntime.hiddenApiUsed`), and call the registered consumer. High-risk calls are rejected based on `targetSdkVersion` and `CompatFramework` policies.\n\n\n"}
