{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T02:03:02Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T10:03:02+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T10:03:04+08:00\nShowing lines 1-120 of 757\n1: +++\n2: title = \"Android 显示系统架构：DisplayManagerService 与 SurfaceFlinger 双层显示管理机制\"\n3: date = 2026-10-12\n4: draft = false\n5: +++\n6: \n7: # Android 显示系统架构：DisplayManagerService 与 SurfaceFlinger 双层显示管理机制\n8: \n9: > **文档版本**: 2.0.0 (Comprehensive Edition)  \n10: > **状态**: 正式发布 (Approved)  \n11: > **涵盖模块**: DisplayManagerService (DMS), WindowManagerService (WMS), SurfaceFlinger (SF), CompositionEngine, HWComposer (HWC), Qualcomm SDM (Snapdragon Display Manager), Linux DRM/KMS  \n12: > **适用平台**: Android 10 ~ Android 14+ (包含 AOSP Phone/Tablet、Foldable 折叠屏、Android Automotive OS 车载多屏以及高通芯片座舱平台)\n13: \n14: ---\n15: \n16: ## 目录\n17: 1. [引言与架构全景](#1-引言与架构全景)\n18: 2. [显示管理的核心双层语义](#2-显示管理的核心双层语义)\n19: 3. [第一层语义：物理显示设备的生命周期管理](#3-第一层语义物理显示设备的生命周期管理)\n20:    - 3.1 [硬件端口感知与 PhysicalDisplayId 编码](#31-硬件端口感知与-physicaldisplayid-编码)\n21:    - 3.2 [Hotplug 热插拔与设备注册全链路](#32-hotplug-热插拔与设备注册全链路)\n22:    - 3.3 [Java 框架内部设备流转与 LogicalDisplay 创建流水线](#33-java-框架内部设备流转与-logicaldisplay-创建流水线)\n23:    - 3.4 [SurfaceFlinger Native 层的 Display 实体体系](#34-surfaceflinger-native-层的-display-实体体系)\n24: 4. [第二层语义：逻辑映射与合成管线（LayerStack、Output 与 Display）](#4-第二层语义逻辑映射与合成管线layerstackoutput-与-display)\n25:    - 4.1 [核心实体定义与概念矩阵](#41-核心实体定义与概念矩阵)\n26:    - 4.2 [DisplayDevice 与 Output 的关系](#42-displaydevice-与-output-的关系)\n27:    - 4.3 [LayerStack 的设计哲学与分配机制（与 DisplayID 的解耦）](#43-layerstack-的设计哲学与分配机制与-displayid-的解耦)\n28:    - 4.4 [LayerStack 与 Output 的空间路由机制](#44-layerstack-与-output-的空间路由机制)\n29:    - 4.5 [OutputLayer：图层在输出端的具象化](#45-outputlayer图层在输出端的具象化)\n30: 5. [经典拓扑映射模式实战](#5-经典拓扑映射模式实战)\n31:    - 5.1 [模式 A：车载独立多屏与座舱显示组隔离（DisplayGroup）](#51-模式-a车载独立多屏与座舱显示组隔离displaygroup)\n32:    - 5.2 [模式 B：显示镜像模式（Display Mirroring）](#52-模式-b显示镜像模式display-mirroring)\n33:    - 5.3 [模式 C：折叠屏内外屏动态切换与设备状态机（Layout）](#53-模式-c折叠屏内外屏动态切换与设备状态机layout)\n34: 6. [运行期核心策略调度](#6-运行期核心策略调度)\n35:    - 6.1 [动态刷新率与分辨率仲裁（DisplayModeDirector）](#61-动态刷新率与分辨率仲裁displaymodedirector)\n36:    - 6.2 [显示电源与平滑亮度调光（DisplayPowerController & DisplayPowerState）](#62-显示电源与平滑亮度调光displaypowercontroller--displaypowerstate)\n37:    - 6.3 [输入视口映射与触控分发（InputManagerService 协同）](#63-输入视口映射与触控分发inputmanagerservice-协同)\n38: 7. [高通平台 (Qualcomm SDM) 硬件合成器实现深度剖析](#7-高通平台-qualcomm-sdm-硬件合成器实现深度剖析)\n39:    - 7.1 [高通 HWC 架构全景与服务入口](#71-高通-hwc-架构全景与服务入口)\n40:    - 7.2 [高通 HWC 启动与 Display 创建全流程时序](#72-高通-hwc-启动与-display-创建全流程时序)\n41:    - 7.3 [核心实现组件深度解析](#73-核心实现组件深度解析)\n42:    - 7.4 [车载虚拟化环境下的典型避坑经验](#74-车载虚拟化环境下的典型避坑经验)\n43: 8. [关键源码对照与跟踪索引](#8-关键源码对照与跟踪索引)\n44: \n45: ---\n46: \n47: ## 1. 引言与架构全景\n48: \n49: 在 Android 显示子系统中，**显示管理（Display Management）** 是连接上层应用界面布局与底层芯片硬件扫描输出的承上启下中枢。上层 `WindowManagerService` (WMS) 负责管理“窗口放在哪块屏上”，下层 `Hardware Composer` (HWC) 负责调度“哪个硬件扫描通道（Pipeline）输出信号”，全部由 **DisplayManagerService (DMS)** 与 **SurfaceFlinger (SF)** 协同完成仲裁、抽象与路由。\n50: \n51: 下图展示了从 Android 顶层应用到芯片显示控制器（DPU）的端到端分层架构图：\n52: \n53: ```\n54: +========================================================================================================+\n55: |                              [Application & Window Management Layer (Java)]                            |\n56: |                                                                                                        |\n57: |    Application / ViewRootImpl                                                                          |\n58: |         │                                                                                              |\n59: |         ▼ (Request to add window)                                                                      |\n60: |    WindowManagerService (WMS)                                                                          |\n61: |         │                                                                                              |\n62: |         ├──> RootWindowContainer                                                                       |\n63: |         │         └──> DisplayContent (Window hierarchy tree per logical display)                     |\n64: |         │                                                                                              |\n65: |         └──> SurfaceControl.setLayerStack(windowLayerStack)                                            |\n66: |                    │                                                                                   |\n67: +====================╪===================================================================================+\n68:                      │                                                                                   \n69: +====================▼===================================================================================+\n70: |                                 [Display Policy Authority: DisplayManagerService]                      |\n71: |                                                                                                        |\n72: |  DisplayManagerService (DMS)                                                                           |\n73: |       │                                                                                                |\n74: |       ├──> LogicalDisplayMapper (Core Mapping Engine)                                                  |\n75: |       │         │                                                                                      |\n76: |       │         ├──> DisplayGroup 0 (Default Group: Driver / System)                                   |\n77: |       │         │         ├──> LogicalDisplay 0 (Default Display, displayId=0, layerStack=0)           |\n78: |       │         │         └──> LogicalDisplay 2 (Cluster Display, displayId=2, layerStack=2)           |\n79: |       │         │                                                                                      |\n80: |       │         └──> DisplayGroup 1 (Passenger Group: Passenger User)                                  |\n81: |       │                   └──> LogicalDisplay 1 (Passenger Display, displayId=1, layerStack=1)         |\n82: |       │                                                                                                |\n83: |       ├──> DisplayDeviceRepository & DisplayAdapter Family                                             |\n84: |       │         ├──> LocalDisplayAdapter   ───> LocalDisplayDevice (Built-in panels, HDMI/DP external) |\n85: |       │         ├──> VirtualDisplayAdapter ───> VirtualDisplayDevice (Record, Cast, CarPlay/Auto)      |\n86: |       │         └──> WifiDisplayAdapter    ───> WifiDisplayDevice (Miracast wireless displays)         |\n87: |       │                                                                                                |\n88: |       ├──> DisplayModeDirector    (Refresh rate 60/120Hz, resolution arbitration)                      |\n89: |       └──> DisplayPowerController (DisplayPowerState, PhotonicModulator thread, ColorFade)             |\n90: +===================================================╪====================================================+\n91:                                                     │ SurfaceControl.Transaction:\n92:                                                     │   - setDisplayLayerStack(displayToken, layerStack)\n93:                                                     │   - setDisplayProjection(displayToken, orient, rect...)\n94:                                                     │   - setDisplayPowerMode(displayToken, mode)\n95: +===================================================▼====================================================+\n96: |                              [Composition Core: SurfaceFlinger & CompositionEngine]                    |\n97: |                                                                                                        |\n98: |  SurfaceFlinger (Main Service State Machine)                                                           |\n99: |       │                                                                                                |\n100: |       ├──> mDisplays map: std::map<IBinder /*token*/, sp<DisplayDevice>>                               |\n101: |       │                                                                                                |\n102: |       └──> CompositionEngine (libcompositionengine)                                                    |\n103: |                 │                                                                                      |\n104: |                 ▼                                                                                      |\n105: |        +──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────+                                |\n106: |        │  DisplayDevice (Native Display Endpoint)                     │                                |\n107: |        │    - Holds: displayToken, DisplayId, PowerMode, ActiveMode   │                                |\n108: |        │    - Owns: std::shared_ptr<compositionengine::Display>       │                                |\n109: |        +──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────+                                |\n110: |                                       │ (C++ inheritance: is-a)                                        |\n111: |                                       ▼                                                                |\n112: |        +──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────+                                |\n113: |        │  compositionengine::Output (Abstract Composition Target)     │                                |\n114: |        │    - Output::State.layerStack (Filtered LayerStack ID)       │                                |\n115: |        │    - Viewport / Frame / Projection spatial transform matrices│                                |\n116: |        │    - RenderSurface / Framebuffer target render buffer        │                                |\n117: |        +──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────+                                |\n118: |                                       │                                                                |\n119: |      ┌────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┐                                 |\n120: |      ▼ (Filtered by LayerStack)                                      ▼                                 |"}
